ight:calc(5px + 16.6667%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Prison\">Roshamuul Prison</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tUnknown\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tDo not waste time on hitting his clone which is invulnerable to any kind of damage. Use an <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Bomb%20Rune\">Energy Bomb Rune</a> underneath you to avoid the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Torturer\">Dark Torturers</a>. Stay Diagonal to avoid beams and waves, and unless you are a <a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knight</a>, stay out of his melee range as well. If you put any DOT (Damage over time)-effect on him (<a href=\"#/wiki/Inflict%20Wound\">Inflict Wound</a> from Knights, <a href=\"#/wiki/Soulfire%20Rune\">Soulfire</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Ignite\">Ignite</a> from Sorcerers, <a href=\"#/wiki/Envenom\">Envenom</a> from Duids and <a href=\"#/wiki/Holy%20Flash\">Holy Flash</a> from Paladins), he stops using his <a href=\"#/wiki/Invisibility\">Invisibility</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 585 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span clas